### Craving Forecast API — run with the REST client in Rider, VS or VS Code
@host = http://localhost:5077
@userId = paste-the-userId-from-the-first-response

### 1. Onboarding quiz → archetype match + day-1 forecast
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wakeHour": 7,
  "bedHour": 23,
  "schedule": "Office",
  "largestMeal": "Dinner",
  "graze": "Fatigue",
  "skip": "Breakfast",
  "triggers": ["Late", "Stress", "Tv"],
  "cravingType": "Sweet",
  "nudgeStyle": "Mix",
  "timeZoneId": "America/Chicago"
}

### 2. Today's forecast
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/forecast

### 3. Morning sync: sleep (tap or HealthKit) + calendar
PUT {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/context/2026-11-20
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sleep": "Poor", "backToBackMeetings": true, "activity": "Low" }

### 4. Check in
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/checkins
Content-Type: application/json

{ "level": 8, "context": ["Late", "Tv"] }

### 5. Zones waiting for "Was this accurate?"
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/feedback/pending

### 6. Answer it (Accurate | Missed | DifferentTime + actualHour)
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-20", "zoneStartHour": 17, "verdict": "DifferentTime", "actualHour": 20 }

### 7. Nudges for the phone to schedule (today + tomorrow)
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/nudges?days=2
